Description: Leopard-style desktop, menu bar and file browser for X11
 Seeker draws the desktop (wallpaper, files in ~/Desktop, mounted drives) and
 runs a global menu bar that follows the active application: real menus from
 GTK 3, Qt, Electron, Chromium and LibreOffice apps, basic menus for the rest,
 a palOS menu, clock, volume, Wi-Fi and tray icons. Opening Seeker gives a
 file browser with icon, list, column and Cover Flow views, Quick Look,
 Get Info, spring-loaded folders, search and the freedesktop Trash.
 .
 The Electron runtime is downloaded once during installation and verified.
